{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "17fec31ee90600188a2e965d65f33ba77994c7b6eb7f7cc4c7ebdef9747fdb7b", "ja": "目指せ！　自分史上最高！？", "zh": "目标是！历史最佳的自己！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0fcdc2ad3f517058b669f4077fdbea96b2fb1749e05e971db679fd8b513c7d42", "ja": "亜利沙、エミリー、琴葉、美奈子、海美の\n対決内容は、写真で自分をどう見せるかの\nセルフプロデュース対決に決まる。亜利沙は\n自分の撮影プランが実現しないことに落ち込\nむものの、皆それぞれ意気込みを見せる。", "zh": "亚利沙、艾米莉、琴叶、美奈子和海美的\n对决内容，最终定为通过照片展现自我的\n自我策划对决。亚利沙因自己的拍摄计划\n无法实现而消沉，不过大家都展现出了各自的干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "75272cd6365cb45fa808f4d07b0c79d0fea81c72d8bc95af04d23dcb0d247227", "ja": "（今回のBOTの内容は決まった！　メンバーに\n展開する資料も作成したし早速ミーティングだ！）", "zh": "（这次BOT的内容定下来了！给成员们准备的资料也做好了，马上开始开会吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "a630847118d13095ca8e072d0bf37833d856f322cef49c3728dcd3adff11b1ef", "ja": "大和撫子闘争八戦目は……\n写真対決ですか？", "zh": "大和抚子争斗第八场是……\n照片对决吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "770307e18b3139b1b699f4f3ce3b5966ac94388ff655305bb643707c5fc6d34d", "ja": "ああ。みんなには自分の写った写真を一枚\n撮ってきてもらいたい。", "zh": "啊。我想让大家各自拍一张有自己入镜的照片带回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f21d53309fe40561f5845925e307a72e2bb5698e0ccf52503799175d218367eb", "ja": "どの一枚がいいか、ネットや劇場の\nお客さん達に投票してもらって1位を決める企画だ。", "zh": "这是一个让网上和剧场的观众投票，决定哪一张照片最好并评出第1位的企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "9a46cdd399d731c8037ee05b45c29dae971d8a10c54abaf13006fdf1fe9115dc", "ja": "写真……。もしかして、ちゃんとしたカメラを\n使った方がいいんでしょうか？", "zh": "照片……是不是还是用专业相机比较好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "174469efc34612b9a66a60e3c4aad44bfb169e6ab238091735dccb72e4967351", "ja": "スマホで充分だよ。写真コンクールではないから。\n加工も落書きも自由にしてくれていい。", "zh": "用手机就够了。毕竟又不是摄影比赛。修图、涂鸦什么的，随你怎么弄都行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "1dc5823c710d4965f7d98dbc2c44d74e41644a00d479e146a9fcaf8c38808532", "ja": "スマホでもいいんだ！　よかった～。\nでも、自分の写った一枚かぁ……難しいね？", "zh": "用手机也可以啊！太好了～  \n不过，要选一张有自己入镜的照片啊……挺难的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "07f74d1ddf83f7dbf7776abea710b11b61649c179cfe1b656820fb0497bd805e", "ja": "みんなに投票してもらうんだもんね。\nメインディッシュ級の一枚にしたいけど……。", "zh": "毕竟是要让大家来投票的嘛。\n虽然很想选出一张主菜级别的照片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "5c5bde05170e005e1fff60cb46893a4d86fee2140c9c80637dfdadb5ec20df7b", "ja": "ふっ……ふっふっふっ……！\nはぁーっはっはっはぁ！！", "zh": "呼……呼呼呼……\n哈哈哈哈哈！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "3897fca6f836d6aa26057d90f98d16c1d77808e9c46fb8fcb16e7b80af1d71cf", "ja": "まずは、お礼を申し上げておきましょう。\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "首先，先容我向您道声谢。\n谢谢您，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b8955968487bf4acb27f26084a168273e6b158871f7f73bdfa10d30da212a776", "ja": "なんだか勿体ぶった言い回しだな……。\nそれで、どうしてお礼なんだ？", "zh": "总觉得你这说法有点故弄玄虚啊……\n所以，为什么要道谢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "f9d26c26b73204f783d1622df5e5da195556af71482e0c02d0a9d4500645a98a", "ja": "だって！　アイドルちゃんの写真企画なんて！\nそんなの、あまりにも神企画過ぎます！　フォォォォ！", "zh": "因为嘛！居然是偶像们的照片企划！\n这也太神了吧！呜哦哦哦哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "5b5109f8d7a8057b831d9a88e9700bdee694e24d2f781bd7bb24f9f0d0e5b8c4", "ja": "みなさん！　なんの心配もいりません！\nすべての撮影プランをありさに任せてください！", "zh": "大家！完全不需要担心！\n请把所有的拍摄计划都交给亚利沙吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "dfaac18a21c47281d1dc8c00f8f1182ca4180aa3173ef0524bee9ffebd04d672", "ja": "亜利沙さんにすべてを、ですか？", "zh": "把一切都交给亚利沙小姐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "968804c382a4aba4a6f4b1250f3d8fb9d3e3c34f9b8d21c87edfee9864b115c5", "ja": "はい！　ありさの考えたパーフェクトな撮影プランで、\nアイドルちゃんの魅力を余すところなく捉え！", "zh": "是！用有理沙构思的完美拍摄方案，把偶像们的魅力一丝不漏地捕捉下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "3e33a2e12a8cf8829a617e932254b6181e548c90c21ae4c7f36dc77364021abc", "ja": "究極完璧絶対不滅の一枚を！！\nこのありさが必ず撮ってみせますよぉ！！", "zh": "终极完美绝对不朽的一张照片！！\n就由我茜茜来，保证拍出来给您看！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b7b30069fd95adf41fac8564a48f863ad3a03a4b43f2bd9dc680741b19b4703b", "ja": "それはダメだ。", "zh": "那可不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "fd53b12c88d8675f85b8ea595c4b2617f125563a7ec1f6292b5f13e851e7a805", "ja": "えええええっ！！！！？？？？", "zh": "诶诶诶诶诶！！！！？？？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "336fa29ba901227b84cc532b9cc164c913b818249a64c5ca1c1dbf2b5235aff2", "ja": "テーマは『自分史上最高の瞬間！　自己肯定感\n爆アゲな一枚♪』で頼みたい。つまり……。", "zh": "主题想定为『属于自己的史上最佳瞬间！让自我肯定感爆棚的一张♪』。也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8dcb5dc891f445e11c73e69674e7f3a5e1ca395a2f98a8a46d009d84c32a7ed6", "ja": "写真で自分をどう見せるか、本人が考えてほしい。\nいわゆるセルフプロデュースってやつだな。", "zh": "希望你本人想想，如何在照片中展现自己。\n也就是所谓的自我策划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "c8eca8c56e602018a086ab6905ce22e5cb7db36d142e1aa4a59aa0a8b9193b03", "ja": "セルフプロデュースということは……\nありさの撮影プランはなにひとつ実現しない、と……？", "zh": "所谓自我策划，也就是说……\n\n亚利沙的拍摄计划一个都实现不了了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b58939e15993a9fbbe61fe167b3d0da7a4b453383812e8af0b374e80e25dbcdb", "ja": "そういうこと。\n自分の写真なら存分に撮影プランを組んでいいぞ。", "zh": "就是这样。\n如果是拍自己的照片，你尽管制定拍摄方案吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "b7e911cb2b7815999e7b26e7c03e9c2eb223fd49391a3fb861aeb98ccc5ec56c", "ja": "ありさのことはどうでもいいんですよぉっ！！\nせっかくの……せっかくの神企画なのにぃ……ううっ。", "zh": "关于亚利沙的事怎样都无所谓啦！！\n难得有这么棒的……这么棒的神企划……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "505e89790c6f47e011497bea9990a6c0534a6cdaf01f43a3f958ce10d7bcd377", "ja": "セルフプロデュースかぁ。SNSに素敵な写真を\nいっぱいあげるとか、そういうことですよね？", "zh": "自我制作啊。就是在社交平台上发布很多漂亮的照片之类的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "9bc131ead7e0432cf3190ec2601eef02ee3a92dfedc05f61762ef715aa36e86b", "ja": "自己肯定感……。\nたしかに、アイドルには大切なものなのかも。", "zh": "自我肯定感……。\n确实，这或许也是偶像很重要的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "0709b9dde6cc07b41ddeade73fd810289d4f095f5ffe5db30fd219c48af3f7f1", "ja": "そうだぞ。亜利沙もアイドルだし。", "zh": "没错。亚利沙也是偶像嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "fb6819edfa7a741c8dfe5fb6577d80ccfd975012a82273a8ca7feb6cde14874c", "ja": "ぎくっ。", "zh": "呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "989cb023e81b507ff6cf377cf11fbd137b8c6f733e493498c5dfb1e75efe730b", "ja": "この機会にあらためて、\n自分と向き合ってみるのもいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "不如借这个机会，重新面对一下自己吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "2ea33f9e15f55369ea59eed8a24ca38a5eb31ba8a03922814a3ce590ae59daea", "ja": "そんな……拷問ですか……？", "zh": "不会吧……这是拷问吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "bb4e8658d3765490bce8788833512289c9079b31b3ec06683f20e3f7638b9d63", "ja": "神企画から拷問とは、評価の変動が激しいな……。\nともあれ、期間内にそれぞれ一枚撮ってきてほしい。", "zh": "从神级企划到拷问，评价变化也太大了……\n不管怎样，希望你们在期限内各拍一张回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "487ef22800019e370cdb0836ad6de6d39f46768eb37cfd219574c47f663ffeb4", "ja": "もちろん、協力はいくらでもするから\n必要な場合は声をかけてくれ！", "zh": "当然，我会全力配合，有需要的话尽管来找我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "1701f23749e03ecd3274c7166b54f36227f0e2255149c1de5b06c42531c6a852", "ja": "わかりました。\nまずは撮影プランを練らないと、ですね！", "zh": "明白了。\n首先得先制定拍摄方案才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_01_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "ac32ec80b791c21d742a75e31f167476b6f68b87bc1861ce721b2e8e40bb662c", "ja": "よーし！　写真から飛び出すぐらい、\n元気いっっっぱいな一枚、撮ってくるね！", "zh": "好——！我会去拍一张活力满满到仿佛要从照片里蹦出来的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
